						"key": "system.description.value",
						"type": "override",
						"value": "{}<p><strong>Cleansing Touch.</strong> You can expend 5 hit points from this pool to cure one disease or remove the &amp;reference[poisoned apply=false] condition on one creature, expending hit points separately for each one. When you expend at least 10 hit points from this pool, whether to restore hit points or cure &amp;reference[poisoned apply=false]{poisons} or diseases, you also end the &amp;reference[drained apply=false] condition on the target.</p>",
